  "duration_s": 82.7,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "如何一眼就能够认出这个人是不是高能量的人？你看他怎么发朋友圈就对了，记录生活，发朋友圈，完全不在意别人的眼光和评价，想拍就拍，想怎么发就怎么发。那么这个人多半是灵魂自带高能量的人。那有人就说了，那么发的多了会不会显得自己很幼稚？其实啊活在成熟套路里的人才叫可悲。高能量的人内心敞亮，活的自在，充满少年气。那们从来都是都不在意别人的眼光。发朋友圈，其实也是纯粹因为热爱生活。那么有人又说了，成年人的世界做人做事还是低调一些吧。这是对低调的误解，那叫枯萎。真正活明白的人啊，既会保留童心，又懂得经营人生，知世故而不世故，利圆滑而留天真。他们发朋友圈啊，也绝不是为了炫耀，而是为了记录生活记录成长。因为当有一天你老了，光翻看这些朋友圈，也够自己开心几十年。这样的人啊好相处，不拧巴，不算计，生活中受欢迎。生意场上还自带流量，做朋友，也不会轻易背叛。因为他们的内心是无惧的、自在的，也是充满正能量的。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 3210,
      "text": "如何一眼就能够认出这个人是不是高能量的人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3430,
      "end_ms": 5430,
      "text": "你看他怎么发朋友圈就对了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5930,
      "end_ms": 6630,
      "text": "记录生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6630,
      "end_ms": 7390,
      "text": "发朋友圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7650,
      "end_ms": 9610,
      "text": "完全不在意别人的眼光和评价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9830,
      "end_ms": 10630,
      "text": "想拍就拍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10830,
      "end_ms": 12470,
      "text": "想怎么发就怎么发。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12690,
      "end_ms": 15950,
      "text": "那么这个人多半是灵魂自带高能量的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16430,
      "end_ms": 17570,
      "text": "那有人就说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17630,
      "end_ms": 20370,
      "text": "那么发的多了会不会显得自己很幼稚？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20970,
      "end_ms": 24410,
      "text": "其实啊活在成熟套路里的人才叫可悲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24410,
      "end_ms": 26610,
      "text": "高能量的人内心敞亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00013",
      "start_ms": 26610,
      "end_ms": 27570,
      "text": "活的自在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00014",
      "start_ms": 27570,
      "end_ms": 28890,
      "text": "充满少年气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28890,
      "end_ms": 31240,
      "text": "那们从来都是都不在意别人的眼光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00016",
      "start_ms": 31560,
      "end_ms": 32320,
      "text": "发朋友圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00017",
      "start_ms": 32620,
      "end_ms": 35140,
      "text": "其实也是纯粹因为热爱生活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00018",
      "start_ms": 35540,
      "end_ms": 36760,
      "text": "那么有人又说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00019",
      "start_ms": 37100,
      "end_ms": 40940,
      "text": "成年人的世界做人做事还是低调一些吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41480,
      "end_ms": 42860,
      "text": "这是对低调的误解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00021",
      "start_ms": 43220,
      "end_ms": 44180,
      "text": "那叫枯萎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00022",
      "start_ms": 44720,
      "end_ms": 46080,
      "text": "真正活明白的人啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00023",
      "start_ms": 46220,
      "end_ms": 47220,
      "text": "既会保留童心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00024",
      "start_ms": 47440,
      "end_ms": 48780,
      "text": "又懂得经营人生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00025",
      "start_ms": 49180,
      "end_ms": 50940,
      "text": "知世故而不世故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00026",
      "start_ms": 51180,
      "end_ms": 53100,
      "text": "利圆滑而留天真。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00027",
      "start_ms": 53680,
      "end_ms": 54840,
      "text": "他们发朋友圈啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00028",
      "start_ms": 54840,
      "end_ms": 56260,
      "text": "也绝不是为了炫耀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00029",
      "start_ms": 56560,
      "end_ms": 59080,
      "text": "而是为了记录生活记录成长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00030",
      "start_ms": 59440,
      "end_ms": 61010,
      "text": "因为当有一天你老了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00031",
      "start_ms": 61190,
      "end_ms": 62470,
      "text": "光翻看这些朋友圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00032",
      "start_ms": 62730,
      "end_ms": 64485,
      "text": "也够自己开心几十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00033",
      "start_ms": 64870,
      "end_ms": 66190,
      "text": "这样的人啊好相处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00034",
      "start_ms": 66390,
      "end_ms": 67090,
      "text": "不拧巴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00035",
      "start_ms": 67310,
      "end_ms": 68085,
      "text": "不算计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00036",
      "start_ms": 68380,
      "end_ms": 69780,
      "text": "生活中受欢迎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00037",
      "start_ms": 69980,
      "end_ms": 71985,
      "text": "生意场上还自带流量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00038",
      "start_ms": 72230,
      "end_ms": 72825,
      "text": "做朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00039",
      "start_ms": 73090,
      "end_ms": 74435,
      "text": "也不会轻易背叛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00040",
      "start_ms": 74910,
      "end_ms": 77705,
      "text": "因为他们的内心是无惧的、自在的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0f9247ca7295ef7c_s00041",
      "start_ms": 78010,
      "end_ms": 80255,
      "text": "也是充满正能量的。"
    }
  ],
